# Rust
/rust/pdf_core/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Note: app/src/main/jniLibs/*/libpdfium.so IS checked in on purpose.
# It is a pinned third-party binary (chromium/7881) that the build cannot
# reproduce locally; tools/fetch_pdfium.ps1 regenerates it.

# Test documents kept at the repo root. These are large — the 2.9 GB catalogue
# used for performance work lives here — and a stray `git add -A` would try to
# commit one. They are inputs to testing, never part of the source.
/*.pdf

# Licensed typefaces supplied for text replacement; see rust/pdf_core/fixtures/fonts/README.md
Century Gothic.zip
